---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL } from '../data/commerce';

// Deliberately a LINK to Stripe's hosted portal login, not an endpoint that mints a portal
// session. An unauthenticated endpoint that turns a checkout session id into a portal session
// would hand anyone holding that id someone else's billing account - their invoices, their card,
// their cancellation. Stripe's login link asks for the customer's own email and mails them a
// link, which is the authentication this site does not otherwise have.
const portalConfigured = CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL.length > 0;
---

<Layout
  title="Manage your billing | ByteLite LLC"
  description="Manage payment methods, invoices and cancellation for a ByteLite LLC subscription through Stripe's secure customer portal."
  keywords="ByteLite billing, manage subscription, cancel subscription"
  canonical="https://www.thebytelite.com/billing/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Billing</p>
      <h1>Manage or cancel your billing.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Payment methods, invoices, plan changes and cancellation are all handled in Stripe's own
        secure portal. ByteLite LLC never stores your card details, so there is nothing here for me
        to hold onto.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      {portalConfigured ? (
        <>
          <p class="body">
            You will be asked for the email address you used at checkout. Stripe sends a link to
            that address, which is how it confirms the account is yours.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href={CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL} class="btn btn-primary" rel="noopener">
              Open the Stripe customer portal
            </a>
          </div>
        </>
      ) : (
        <p class="body">
          There is no billing to manage yet. No subscription on this site is active and nothing has
          been charged, so the portal is not configured. If you think you have been billed by
          ByteLite LLC, <a href="/contact">contact me directly</a>.
        </p>
      )}

      <h2 class="mt">Cancelling.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        Cancellation is one action in that portal. There is no retention flow, no phone call, no
        "are you sure" chain and nothing you have to email me to unlock. If you ever find that
        cancelling is harder than starting, that is a bug and I want to know about it.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        A founder reservation is not a subscription and has nothing to cancel. If you want to be
        taken off the founder list, <a href="/contact">ask</a> and I will remove you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.narrow { max-width: 780px; }
.page-hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
.hero-sub { max-width: 640px; font-size: 1.0625rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; }
h2 { margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.mt { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
.body { font-size: 1rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem; }
.cta-row { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
</style>
